@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Перевірка анонімного доступу до інциденту Alice
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/incidents/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### Lab06 — Production: перевірка доступності OpenAPI
GET http://localhost:5080/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/problem+json

### Lab06 — Production: перевірка Scalar
GET http://localhost:5080/scalar/v1
Accept: text/html

###  Production: перевірка некоректного status
GET http://localhost:5080/api/incidents?status=InvalidStatusLab06
Accept: application/problem+json

###  Production: неіснуючий інцидент
GET http://localhost:5080/api/incidents/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
Accept: application/problem+json

###  Production: контрольована помилка 500
POST http://localhost:5080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/problem+json
{
  "userName": "alice",
  "password": "USED_TO_BE_A_PASSWORD"
}

### перевірка після відновлення підключення
GET http://localhost:5080/health

### Bob cannot view Alice
GET http://localhost:5080/api/incidents/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
Accept: application/json
Cookie: USED_TO_BE_A_TOKEN

### Alice can view her own incident
GET http://localhost:5080/api/incidents/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
Accept: application/json
Cookie: USED_TO_BE_A_TOKEN

### XSS Incident
GET http://localhost:5080/api/incidents/857e4d2e-57d9-4d15-857c-1e2ef8bba87e
Accept: application/json


### Incident without CSRF Token
POST http://localhost:5080/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: USED_TO_BE_A_TOKEN

{
  "title": "REG-CSRF-01 No Token",
  "description": "CSRF regression test",
  "severity": "Low",
  "occurredAtUtc": "2026-11-11T10:00:00Z"
}


### Incident did not get created with no token
GET http://localhost:5080/api/incidents/search?q=REG-CSRF-01%20No%20Token
Accept: application/json

### Alice CSRF Token
GET http://localhost:5080/api/antiforgery/token
Accept: application/json
Cookie: USED_TO_BE_A_TOKEN

### Positive CSRF Token scene
POST http://localhost:5080/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: USED_TO_BE_A_TOKEN
X-CSRF-TOKEN: USED_TO_BE_A_TOKEN

{
  "title": "REG-CSRF-01 Valid Token",
  "description": "Incident created with valid CSRF token",
  "severity": "Low",
  "occurredAtUtc": "2026-11-11T10:00:00Z"
}

### Checking an incident with token
GET http://localhost:5080/api/incidents/search?q=REG-CSRF-01%20Valid%20Token
Accept: application/json
